{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-11-16","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：平面与平行线","englishTitle":"If two parallel planes be cut by any plane, their common sections are parallel.","book":11,"number":16,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.16","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.16/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":16,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-11-16@raw-5847205eefd13c86","contentId":"euclid-11-16","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5847205eefd13c86b26cdf827959fe7b6a0ec5e177b52dd8e7913f2ba232a91b","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-11-16.statement","euclid-11-16.construction.1","euclid-11-16.proof.1","euclid-11-16.construction.2","euclid-11-16.proof.2","euclid-11-16.proof.3","euclid-11-16.proof.4","euclid-11-16.proof.5","euclid-11-16.proof.6","euclid-11-16.proof.7","euclid-11-16.proof.8","euclid-11-16.conclusion","euclid-11-16.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-11-16.statement","contentId":"euclid-11-16","revisionId":"euclid-11-16@raw-5847205eefd13c86","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4dec8d2d65feff8ccdfcb97471be90b613b1a4f10d2796d0e076d591641d8fc9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two parallel planes be cut by any plane, their common sections are parallel."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个平行的平面 被任何平面 削减,它们的共同部分是平行的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-16.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-11-16","revisionId":"euclid-11-16@raw-5847205eefd13c86","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0dd10bef8e3462dc93ab1bb6575adb888a2ad865947658a5f157f2812be9a4c0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the two parallel planes AB, CD be cut by the plane EFGH, and let EF, GH be their common sections; I say that EF is parallel to GH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将平行的平面 AB CD 改为平面 EFGH,EF GH 成为它们的共同部分;我说,EF 与GH 相平行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-16.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-11-16","revisionId":"euclid-11-16@raw-5847205eefd13c86","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1f00f8b3510fc54b1c93f2bd50e1d92a109d33b65f4ea3f1ceccede13286ec72","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if not, EF, GH will, when produced, meet either in the direction of F, H or of E, G."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"否则,EF,GH在延长后,会相交,即F,H或E,G。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-16.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-11-16","revisionId":"euclid-11-16@raw-5847205eefd13c86","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"43502e9dd79341e1dd7e148906bfbe1956bfb5e1e56b47ff6dcd538440a1e221","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let them be produced, as in the direction of F, H, and let them, first, meet at K."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它们按F,H的方向延长,首先在K处相互相交。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-16.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-11-16","revisionId":"euclid-11-16@raw-5847205eefd13c86","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a60aa56a7bf9b276b5253209977aefe2bf2c7748c42ca2a6339e6500475b2c30","citations":["euclid-11-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since EFK is in the plane AB, therefore all the points on EFK are also in the plane AB. [[XI. 1](/principles/euclid-11-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,EFK是平面 AB, 所以EFK上的所有点也是平面 AB。 [[XI. 1](/principles/euclid-11-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-16.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-11-16","revisionId":"euclid-11-16@raw-5847205eefd13c86","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f34105d198f05e854f9a1f87c3095dbbe41b49b694d2b039d759e3453cf789a2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But K is one of the points on the straight line EFK; therefore K is in the plane AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但K是EFK线的一线,因此K是平面 AB线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-16.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-11-16","revisionId":"euclid-11-16@raw-5847205eefd13c86","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4ac68c681aa1d4aa6f3ca1092d5d23dec4b9b7832543d3458d5b89dd80fd01b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason K is also in the plane CD; therefore the planes AB, CD will meet when produced."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,K也是平面 CD;因此,平面 AB CD在延长时将相互相交。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-16.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-11-16","revisionId":"euclid-11-16@raw-5847205eefd13c86","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9daa36b654cb2883365a2d4ed2d4bdfee4fac4deca5f6f7dd22422d29aeac345","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But they do not meet, because they are, by hypothesis, parallel; therefore the straight lines EF, GH will not meet when produced in the direction of F, H."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但这些线并不相互相交,因为假设它们平行;因此,EF、GH直线在延伸至F、H方向时不会相互相交。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-16.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-11-16","revisionId":"euclid-11-16@raw-5847205eefd13c86","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"353a419a66860ecf19b732745d0ae5d69a3c118919794b7aa14da5e4bc43667a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that neither will the straight lines EF, GH meet when produced in the direction of E, G."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,EF、GH直线在延伸至E、G方向时也不会相互相交。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-16.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-11-16","revisionId":"euclid-11-16@raw-5847205eefd13c86","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"842f8764efad4927c4874143bad598c5be5b849a3d09ad749081235854532bc0","citations":["euclid-1-def-23"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But straight lines which do not meet in either direction are parallel. [[I. Def. 23](/principles/euclid-1-def-23)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,两条方向之间没有相交的直线是平行的。 [[I. Def. 23](/principles/euclid-1-def-23)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-16.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-11-16","revisionId":"euclid-11-16@raw-5847205eefd13c86","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4cf87360ffeab6ed1689e30f30ced67eb833a8a18483e6d90f914de842d96bcb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore EF is parallel to GH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,EF项与GH项平行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-16.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-11-16","revisionId":"euclid-11-16@raw-5847205eefd13c86","order":11,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-16.source","contentId":"euclid-11-16","revisionId":"euclid-11-16@raw-5847205eefd13c86","order":12,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"954c306194463558c25e52395ef74b7c25e2a0c493bdc28ce7fa5dc9ff34563e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.16/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.16\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-11-16:euclid-11-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-16","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-16.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.16","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.16/","sourceLabel":"XI. 1"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-16:euclid-1-def-23:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-16","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-16.