量关系：平面与平行四边形与平行线","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-solid","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
